OL,3,GGrampian
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FBright spells and a few light
OL,6,Fshowers this morning. Becoming rather
OL,7,Fcloudy this afternoon but remaining
OL,8,Fdry. Brisk northwesterly winds in the
OL,9,Feast soon easing.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FA cloudy evening with rain
OL,12,Fspreading from the west. Drier and
OL,13,Fclearer weather will develop during
OL,14,Fthe early hours. Fresh southwesterly
OL,15,Fwinds at times.
OL,16,
OL,17,CThursday:FSome bright or sunny spells
OL,18,Fand scattered showers, these heaviest
OL,19,Fand most frequent across the west.
OL,20,FFresh to strong westerly winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
